120
00:06:44.611 --> 00:06:47.022
Intuition: counting cars on a highway.

121
00:06:47.302 --> 00:06:55.323
You can't write down every car's number plate to answer which car models are most common today? but you can keep tallies for the models you see most.

122
00:06:55.603 --> 00:07:02.131
How many different cars passed? can be estimated from the rarest patterns in the plates, without storing every plate.

123
00:07:02.411 --> 00:07:04.310
Tallies from two toll booths add up.

124
00:07:04.590 --> 00:07:08.942
Distinct cars across the two booths don't, because the same car passes both.

125
00:07:09.222 --> 00:07:14.385
And unusual traffic means more than normal for this road at this hour, not the busiest road.

